[24.8159, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[2;87H› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: CLI surface.\u001b[K\u001b[3;87H  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions.  \u001b[4;87H  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks  \u001b[5;87H  you to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[6;87H\u001b[K\n  When the human is ready to finish, they can type /finish on its own in this pane.   \u001b[8;87H  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[K\u001b[9;87H\u001b[K\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[11;87H  In English, suggest two ways to simplify overlapping CLI commands. Start your       \u001b[12;87H  answer with CLI:. Max 30 words. Do not use tools.\u001b[K\u001b[13;87H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mCLI: 1) Merge commands that perform the same action, using options for variations.  \u001b[16;87H  2) Standardize resource-action naming and deprecate redundant aliases with clear    \u001b[17;87H  migration guidance.\u001b[K\u001b[18;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n  Worked for 12s • 14:16                                                "]
